      "text": "I don’t like the term “generative AI”\n\nThe truly shocking part of LLMs &amp; diffusion models isn’t their ability to generate—it’s their ability to understand and reason like humans\n\nThe most shocking use cases will be where we trust AI to make decisions, not just create content",
