      "text": "Big obvious gap of today’s AI:\n\nThey are *intelligence machines*, not *learning machines*.\n\nLarge language models are quite proficient, but do not continue learning, &amp; require large industrial processes to get smarter.\n\nThey can mimic, but they do not truly progress like humans.",
